This package implements the ecdsa-sd-2023 cryptosuite of the W3C Recommendation Data Integrity ECDSA Cryptosuites v1.0. It
includes no file of W3C: the contexts and the test vectors that its tests read are downloaded at pinned hashes and never
committed.

It builds on @digitalbazaar/di-sd-primitives (BSD-3-Clause, Digital Bazaar, Inc.) with jsonld and rdf-canonize beneath it,
cborg (Apache-2.0), @noble/curves (MIT) and @scure/base (MIT).

